# --- Large data objects ---
# Pre-processed, pseudobulk, and scored Seurat objects are large (tens to
# hundreds of MB) and are regenerated by running each dataset's .Rmd
# against its raw input data -- keep them out of git.
*.rds

# Rendered notebook previews (self-contained HTML, embeds every plot as
# base64 -- can run several MB per notebook) -- regenerated by re-knitting
# the source .Rmd, so not worth tracking.
*.nb.html

# Local R package library (R/ -- packages missing from the container
# image: multcomp, sandwich, TH.data as of this writing; picked up
# automatically as R's default per-user library path since the
# container's $HOME is bound to this directory -- see README's "Running
# the analyses"). Not tracked: reinstall with install.packages() instead
# of carrying ~150 binary package files in git.
/R/

# Raw GEO download for the SUM149PT cell-line dataset (Brown, Abdollahi,
# Wilkins et al. 2022, Sci. Adv. 8, eabj8002; re-fetchable from the
# GSE172609 GEO accession page -- the RNA-seq SubSeries of SuperSeries
# GSE172613; nf-core_fetchngs.sh/ids.csv target a raw-read reprocessing
# path that the current notebook doesn't actually use -- see README's
# Known gaps)
datasets/TNBC_cellline_SUM149PT_GSE172609/from_geo/

# Per-dataset raw/large input data (self-contained under each dataset
# directory, one `data/` per dataset -- covers both the 4 below and every
# dataset under datasets/):
# - Baugh2024_GSE261252/data/: raw 10x outs directories (GEO accession
#   GSE261252; see baugh_BH4paper_prep.Rmd's "Raw data" section) --
#   rename.sh is small provenance code, not data, so it's kept
# - BRCA_atlas_CellxGene_Chen/data/: CZ CELLxGENE h5ad, downloaded on
#   demand by ChenAtlas_malignant_pseudobulk_prep.Rmd (re-fetchable from
#   the URL in that notebook)
# - BRCA_TCGA/data/: Broad Firehose batch-corrected pan-cancer matrix +
#   clinical metadata (original GDC/Firehose hosting pages are dead;
#   provenance tracked via citation instead -- see TCGA_BRCA_prep.Rmd's
#   "Raw data" section)
datasets/*/data/*
!datasets/Baugh2024_GSE261252/data/rename.sh

# Staging area + tarball built by pack_input_data.sh (mirrors every
# gitignored data file above under one directory for distribution outside
# git -- see README's "Large files / data availability" and
# restore_input_data.sh). Never tracked -- same reasoning as the data
# itself, just bundled.
/input_data/
/input_data.tar.gz

# --- RStudio / R session state ---
# These land in the project directory because the Singularity container's
# $HOME is bound to $PWD (see singularity_Rstudio_451.sh) -- none of it is
# source or data.
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.cache/
.config/
.local/

# --- SLURM job logs from singularity_Rstudio_451.sh ---
slurm.*.out
slurm.*.err

# --- OS/editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
